Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: Korean title version banner
Applies after 0061-korean-battle-yesno.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

Korean build only (GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_KOREAN): the version banner of the
Korean title screen (staged from the player's ROM) uses 144 colors instead of 16.

diff --git a/src/title_screen.c b/src/title_screen.c
--- a/src/title_screen.c
+++ b/src/title_screen.c
@@ -667,7 +667,12 @@
         LoadCompressedSpriteSheet(&sSpriteSheet_EmeraldVersion[0]);
         LoadCompressedSpriteSheet(&sSpriteSheet_PressStart[0]);
         LoadCompressedSpriteSheet(&sPokemonLogoShineSpriteSheet[0]);
+#if GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_KOREAN
+        // The Korean version banner has 144 colors.
+        LoadPalette(gTitleScreenEmeraldVersionPal, OBJ_PLTT_ID(0), 144 * sizeof(u16));
+#else
         LoadPalette(gTitleScreenEmeraldVersionPal, OBJ_PLTT_ID(0), PLTT_SIZE_4BPP);
+#endif
         LoadSpritePalette(&sSpritePalette_PressStart[0]);
         gMain.state = 2;
         break;
